# netsurf: cross-realm frames + postMessage (claude.ai Google sign-in completion, Increment 2)
#
# An iframe's document runs in its own JSRuntime. The two now talk through
# postMessage, carrying only C strings (JSON) between runtimes -- a JSValue
# never crosses (the Vita cross-runtime free crashes, fixes 861/875/888/
# 1070/1117b):
#
# - macsurf_qjs.c: jsheap gains parent_heap + frame_key (frames.c links a
#   frame's heap to its parent's, js_link_frame_heaps). Natives
#   __vitaPostMessageToParent / __vitaPostMessageToIframe /
#   __vitaIframeContentDocKey / __vitaFrameRealmName queue JSON text; the
#   pump (macsurf_qjs_pump_all) drains it into the target realm, where the
#   MessageEvent is built in C (data = JSON.parse of the text, origin,
#   source stand-in with postMessage/close) and dispatched with the realm's
#   own window.dispatchEvent. A child is found by its heap link (frame name,
#   else index), layout boxes only as a fallback. destroyheap clears
#   back-links and purges messages queued for the dying realm.
# - vita_polyfill.js: per-realm shim windows (parent/top in a frame realm;
#   window.frames and iframe.contentWindow / contentDocument in the top
#   realm); shims JSON-encode every message.
#
# Written by Hermes (local agent); finished here. The full sim run crashed
# (SIGSEGV, a jump through a garbage class slot): macsurf_qjs_xrealm_register
# freed __vitaFrameRealmName after JS_SetPropertyStr had taken ownership, so
# the global kept a freed function that the polyfill called once the memory
# was reused. Also fixed before it shipped: the drain stored the global
# object twice without a reference (over-release every message) and aliased
# ev/w on failure (double free), recomputed the queue tail wrongly, and could
# deliver into a freed heap; the shims' self-references were undefined
# (read inside their own initializer); window.frames used Proxy (absent from
# the host QuickJS: the rest of the window setup aborted); contentWindow was
# installed on the prototype all elements share; data arrived as JSON text.
# Test page JS-xrealm.html + js-xrealm-child.html: 4/4 in tools/
# run-vita-sim.sh (child to parent, round trip, string stays string,
# event.source.postMessage).
diff --git a/content/handlers/javascript/quickjs/macsurf_qjs.c b/content/handlers/javascript/quickjs/macsurf_qjs.c
index 894318cfa..4e0c7c6f0 100644
--- a/content/handlers/javascript/quickjs/macsurf_qjs.c
+++ b/content/handlers/javascript/quickjs/macsurf_qjs.c
@@ -44,6 +44,15 @@
 #include "content/handlers/html/box.h"
 #include "content/handlers/html/box_inspect.h"
 #include "content/handlers/html/box_construct.h"
